<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence persists in South Sudan with a Christian woman killed by her brother for resisting a forced marriage, a boda-boda rider shot dead by an armed passenger in Wau, and two Kapoeta youths killed after an SSPDF arrest. In Kapoeta South a SPLM secretary and a friend were killed, while revenge killings are consuming a generation in Tonj. Vice President Taban questioned the President's accessibility, and the Ministry of Gender is reviewing draft safe-house guidelines for GBV survivors. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQNDlEbFFqNV9idmhGSWo4RzVkTFA4cTd2S01JQ1RhcTY3UU4tdTBIbVpZcnMwY3R5SkU3UDhuU1RQOHNOV2tPSndlQ0JhMERSd25zSUNQdS01VUNXeW1rWGtMUG1QNXpRVDRxSE1BdlF5V3d1VGpGWGpKMUkxX1dnRnFDRVpwc2prMk9zMWl6Tk5aSU13S1pUZ1RMemdwT0FEZXZWOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Christian Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1VcDU5MnFpdlB2b1diakFLTmI0OTZUQWI0b2pleG9nQ3BISmVrTXZRaHg2UUgzUy1aZ3RITkt6czNYTHAwZ3VXb3A4ZlR0QXg2RlVubHhyaE1BdS1zV2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Jagonews24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1pbkFIUFo0MnJCaWJMejVKbGRkZkRNZ3BVQ296Z21IU0RQZV9HVkFCbk1FRl9lekdwelRjR25ISVdCNVZnM0RwLTZTam5aUmU4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;OkayAfrica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQbmE0ZDd1cV9UbmdtRVVtNGk3cVJManFwSnFDNEZRSmNoTll4ZW1RcmZKQjhlVDVZQ2lwUGpmUUJwd2dRLUZZZ004VW9NUUt4dmZDcmNhb3RObDNIeFRrQWx6ckNDNjZkODkzaGxTQ1BjakI0N2hNZEFQYVNZRWZDbUdZOHRHbmFpNmNVMzBtZDNrRnlPUjdHbHBReEQx